OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to monitor 'Gnome-man's
OL,4,Aland' roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has said it will continue to
OL,7,Fmonitor a roundabout after a couple
OL,8,Fdecorated it with garden gnomes "to
OL,9,Fmake people smile".
OL,11,FThe pair, who spoke to the BBC
OL,12,Fanonymously, said the "fantastic
OL,13,Ffeedback" from people in and around
OL,14,FLong Eaton, Derbyshire, prompted them
OL,15,Fto set up a petition to rename the
OL,16,Froundabout "Gnome-man's land".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
