OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to monitor 'Gnome-man's
OL,4,Aland' roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said they came up with the idea of
OL,7,Fdecorating the roundabout next to Long
OL,8,FEaton train station after they decided
OL,9,Fthey could not throw away a number of
OL,10,F"tatty" gnomes found in a garden shed
OL,11,Fduring a summer clear-out.
OL,13,FSpeaking anonymously as Mr Gnome, he
OL,14,Fsaid: "It's been so nice to hear all
OL,15,Fthe positive feedback that we've had
OL,16,Ffrom it all."
